WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Many organizations use the CIS Controls as a foundation for security improvement.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.255
By implementing safeguards, reviewing progress, and improving operational practices,

00:00:08.255 --> 00:00:09.935
organizations can strengthen resilience.

00:00:09.935 --> 00:00:15.000
The controls help transform security from an abstract concept into actionable activities.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.981
That makes them useful for planning, measurement, communication, and long-term maturity.

00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:21.995
A security program can use the controls to identify what matters now,

00:00:21.995 --> 00:00:23.000
what should come next,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.995
and how progress should be communicated to leaders and stakeholders.

00:00:25.995 --> 00:00:29.895
The long-term value comes from continuous improvement: choosing priorities,

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:32.000
implementing safeguards, reviewing results,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.990
and adapting as risks and business needs change.
